{"title":"커맨더 리포트(Commander Report) [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"\t\n스치는 우연인 줄로만 알았다.\n\n\"그때보다 더 잘생겼네.\"\n\"이, 거, 쫌! 좀!\"\n\"이게 훨씬 나은데?\"\n\n고작 막대 사탕 하나가 이어버린 이 기막힌 우연이 정말 우연일까? 그가 만든 덫은 아닐까.\n\n\"뭘 그렇게 떨어. 요. 기자님.\"\n\n단순히 붙인 요는 분명, 겉치레에 불과했다.\n\n최악이었다. 모든 것이.\n특히 저놈의 웃는 얼굴은 더더욱.\n\n\"표정 풀어. 파비.\"","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":239,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":275,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":57477,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":57477,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":57477,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":57477,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":57477,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":57477,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":57478,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":57478,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":57479,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":57485,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":57500,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":57501,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":57501,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":57501,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":57512,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":57512,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":57512,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":57512,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-29","v":57512,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40},{"date":"2026-10-30","v":57512,"rc":891,"rs":8215,"cc":40}]}